<title>JAPAN: Mori Seiki to buy back up to 1 mln of its shares.</title>
<headline>Mori Seiki to buy back up to 1 mln of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mori Seiki Co Ltd said on Friday that it has  decided to buy back up to one million, or up to two billion yen worth,  of its shares.  </p>
<p>Mori, based in Nara in western Japan, is a major maker of lathes and  other industrial machines.</p>
